          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「刑事は厳しい口調で容疑者を締め上げ、ついに真実を語らせた。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「不祥事を起こした部下を別室に呼び、徹底的に締め上げて反省を促した。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「ライバル企業を価格競争で締め上げ、市場から追い出そうと画策する。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "to settle accounts",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "「決算期を前に、帳簿の数字を細かく締め上げて誤差を無くしていく。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「一日の売り上げを締め上げている間は、店内に緊張した空気が流れる。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「使途不明金が出ないよう、各部署の予算を厳しく締め上げる必要がある。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
